Subject: [PATCH] Decompile Mima's intro and defeat code and retire
 th02/main_03_.asm

Mima's functions are compiled without -G (POP CX after the KAJA fade), so
they continue skill_calculate()'s TU. The Tupfile MAIN link order now
matches the verified response file.
